      "note": "Cable Network Programming brand cluster: Fox News Channel, Fox Business, FS1, FS2. The Cable Network Programming label text is x-interleaved with the logos (starts x184/x208 on the upper rows while FS1/FS2 reach x225), so the two label-text fragments are blanked via excludeBoxes; excludes the segment label, values, margin text, and flow marks."
    },
    {
      "key": "fox-television-cluster",
